      "We manage the finish scope of kitchen, bath, basement and interior renovation work and coordinate licensed plumbers and electricians for their portions. Removing or altering a load-bearing wall needs a licensed professional and the appropriate permit. Permits and inspections go through the town's building department when the work requires them. Ashburnham is about 25 miles from our Hudson shop, so we plan material deliveries and inspection dates carefully to keep full work days on site."
