      "answer": "Yes, though we'll plan around it. Pressure washers draw a steady flow, so we check how well your supply keeps up and may run at lower volume, pause between walls, or hand-scrub some sections with a garden hose. Many older painted surfaces are better cleaned gently anyway, since aggressive washing can force water behind siding and damage soft wood."
