      "With about 94 percent of homes owner-occupied, most cabinet projects here are for families who plan to stay and use the kitchen every day. We take doors and drawer fronts to be sprayed away from the house and work on the boxes in place with the room masked. The cure period matters as much as the painting itself, so we explain how to treat the new finish during the first weeks. Because Ashby is about 24 miles from Hudson, door pickup and return are set on fixed days."
