      "answer": "Yes. We coordinate the trades, confirm who arrives when, and check the work at each stage. You get photos and updates, and we ask for your approval before any change in scope. We need a secure way for the trades to get in, such as a lockbox, and clear instructions about pets and any areas of the house that stay off limits."
