      "answer": "We plan it before the first day. We check whether trucks can reach the house and where materials can be staged, and if access is tight, we arrange smaller deliveries or a staging spot near the road. We schedule trades so each visit covers as much as possible, keep the driveway clear of debris, and protect the edges of lawns and beds along the route. That way access stays open for the whole project and your property is not torn up."
