      "We handle demolition, non-bearing framing, drywall, trim, cabinets and painting, and coordinate licensed plumbers and electricians. A&M is a registered Massachusetts Home Improvement Contractor (HIC #207214) without a Construction Supervisor License, so work on bearing walls or framing requires a licensed professional and a permit. Permits and inspections go through the building department when needed. Some Split-level walls between the kitchen and living areas carry load, so we plan for that before promising an open layout."
