      "Many owners here plan work in phases, sometimes one unit at a time. We handle the finish side of a remodel and coordinate licensed plumbers and electricians for the work they must do. Structural changes need a licensed professional and the appropriate permit, and we will say so up front rather than work around it. When the work requires permits and inspections, those go through the city's building department."
