      "We handle the finish side of a remodel and coordinate licensed plumbers and electricians for the work they are required to do. Removing a wall or changing framing is a different matter: structural changes need a licensed professional and the appropriate permit, and we will not treat them as routine. When the work calls for permits and inspections, those go through the town's building department. The job site is about 29 miles from the Hudson shop, so we sequence each trade carefully to avoid idle days."
