      "The rural setting helps in practical ways. At around 223 people per square mile, there is usually space for a dumpster and material staging without blocking a neighbor, and delivery trucks can get close. We handle demolition of finishes, drywall, trim, tile preparation and painting, and coordinate licensed plumbers and electricians. A&M Painter Inc holds Massachusetts HIC registration #207214 but not a Construction Supervisor License, so structural changes need a licensed professional and the appropriate permit, and permits and inspections go through the town's building department when required."
