      "The town sits about 28.7 miles from our Hudson shop, between Melrose, Lynn, Malden and Revere, so scheduling is planned to cut wasted trips. Older homes, and 73 percent here predate 1980, often hold surprises behind walls: undersized framing, old wiring or earlier repairs. We leave room in the plan to address those as they appear. The business holds a Massachusetts HIC (#207214) and no Construction Supervisor License, so structural changes need a licensed professional and the appropriate permit."
