      "Owners here often plan remodels to match the quality of the rest of a well-kept house rather than doing a quick cosmetic refresh. A&M handles demolition, drywall, finish carpentry and painting, and coordinates licensed plumbers and electricians. Taking out a wall, enlarging an opening or removing a soffit that hides a beam needs a licensed professional and the appropriate permit. Permits and inspections go through the town's building department whenever the work requires them."
