      "Space is the other factor. In a second- or third-floor unit, doors and drawer fronts go down the stairs to be sprayed off site, and the boxes are sanded and finished in place with the kitchen sealed off from the rest of the apartment. Cabinets in homes built before 1978, which covers most of a housing stock with a 1938 median, may have old paint layers that need lead-safe handling. We explain how long the finish needs to cure before normal use and plan around a household that still needs to eat."
