      "Our side of the work is the interior renovation: demolition, drywall, trim, cabinet installation, tile prep and paint. Licensed plumbers and electricians handle their trades, and we coordinate their visits. Moving or removing a bearing wall is another matter; structural changes need a licensed professional and the right permit, and permits and inspections go through the town's building department when the work calls for them. A basement finish in a newer Contemporary or Cape can be simpler than a kitchen in an old farmhouse."
