      "A&M handles demolition, non-structural framing, drywall, trim and painting, and we coordinate licensed plumbers and electricians for their parts of the job. Our registration is as a Massachusetts Home Improvement Contractor, HIC #207214. Changes to bearing walls, beams or the foundation need a licensed professional and the appropriate permit. About 6 percent of homes here are in two-to-four-unit buildings, where shared walls and utility lines need extra planning. Permits and inspections go through the town's building department when the work requires them."
