      "The housing also spans eras. Victorian and Colonial Revival homes, Mid-century houses near the city's 1962 median build year, and loft units in converted watch factory buildings all bring different surprises behind the walls. We handle interior renovation and coordinate licensed plumbers and electricians. Anything that alters a bearing wall is designed by a licensed professional and permitted before we build around it. When a permit is required, inspections go through the city's building department. In a loft condominium, read the association's rules before planning."
