      "Our role is to coordinate. We schedule licensed plumbers and electricians, keep the site ready for each of them, and do the carpentry, drywall and paint ourselves. Structural changes go to a licensed professional with the appropriate permit. With 80% of homes owner-occupied, we plan for families staying in the house during the work, grouping the loudest and messiest phases together so the disruption comes in fewer, shorter stretches rather than dragging across the whole project."
