      "With 87 percent of homes owner-occupied, most interiors we would paint here are lived in during the work. That means moving room by room, keeping one bathroom and the kitchen usable, and cleaning up each evening. As an EPA Lead-Safe (RRP) certified firm, we set up plastic containment and HEPA cleanup whenever older painted trim or walls get sanded. Wilmington is about 24 miles from our Hudson shop, so we plan interior jobs as a continuous block of days instead of scattered visits."
